{"id":"c571239d865f","publishedAt":1795664710000,"posts":[[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/nikoniko_style/imgs/d/4/d469d14e.jpg"},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"【引用画像】出典：『HUNTER×HUNTER』"},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"1 "},{"size":10,"text":"2026/11/16(月)"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"\n幽遊白書の桑原、ハンターハンターのレオリオの役割とは何か？"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"\n凡人である読者が感情移入するための凡人キャラなのか？ "},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"6 "},{"br":1},{"size":24,"color":"#CC3333","text":"桑原は見せ場多かったけど"},{"br":1},{"size":24,"color":"#CC3333","text":"レオリオは正直持て余してるだろ"},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"8 "},{"br":1},{"size":18,"color":"#006699","text":">>6"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"color":"#006699","text":" まともな戦闘シーンないもんな"},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"2 "},{"br":1},{"size":24,"color":"#CC3333","text":"桑原は次元刀\n"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/nikoniko_style/imgs/2/e/2ec25dcf.jpg"},{"br":1},{"size":10,"color":"#CC3333","text":"【引用画像】出典：『幽遊白書』"},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"5 "},{"br":1},{"size":18,"color":"#006699","text":"桑原はブリーチの織姫みたいな感じ。"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"color":"#006699","text":"物語中盤でチート能力だと明かされる"},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"7 "},{"br":1},{"size":24,"color":"#CC3333","text":"桑原の次元刀もレオリオの選挙も"},{"br":1},{"size":24,"color":"#CC3333","text":"バトルでは活躍させようがないから"},{"br":1},{"size":24,"color":"#CC3333","text":"違う形で活躍させたんじゃないか "},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"9 "},{"br":1},{"size":24,"color":"#CC3333","text":"日常に戻すためのキャラだろ"},{"br":1},{"size":24,"color":"#CC3333","text":"戦わなくて良いんだよ "},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"\n引用元\n"},{"size":10,"text":"https://viper.2ch.sc/test/read.cgi/news4vip/1794761613/"}]],"comments":[]}